      "value": "B-AACC - BACnet Advanced Access Control Controller"
    },
    "productDescription": {
      "provenance": "user-entered",
      "value": "An Advanced Access Control Controller built on the CAS BACnet Stack (a Blocked Example: it does not perform access control). It serves the access object family - Access Door, Credential Data Input, Access Point, Access Zone, Access Credential, Access Rights and Access User - plus three sensor objects, an Event Log, a Schedule that unlocks its door, a Calendar, a File object for backup and restore, a Notification Class and a Network Port. It executes ReadProperty(Multiple), WriteProperty(Multiple), SubscribeCOV, AcknowledgeAlarm, GetEventInformation, DeviceCommunicationControl, ReinitializeDevice, time synchronization and file access, and initiates ReadProperty, WriteProperty and SubscribeCOV against a peer door controller. It is a tutorial for implementers of the B-AACC profile."
    },
    "productName": {
      "provenance": "user-entered",
      "value": "CAS BACnet Stack Example - B-AACC"
    },
